; The FROST(secp256k1, SHA-256) ciphersuite, over Mirage_crypto_ec's P256k1.Primitive:
; fiat-crypto scalar arithmetic and ECCKiila's regular-wNAF ladder, both constant time.
;
; Deliberately NOT over mirage-crypto-blockchain's Secp256k1, which exposes the same
; group but as plain zarith double-and-add with an explicit NOT CONSTANT TIME banner.
; That one is fine for verifying public data and unusable for a secret key share.
;
; Like the Ed25519 suite, this pulls in no bignum: the scalar field is the curve's own.

(library
 (name mpc_secp256k1)
 (public_name mpc.secp256k1)
 (libraries mpc digestif eqaf mirage-crypto-ec))
